</div><div><a id="f_005"></a></div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><b>NEWGENIVF GROUP LIMITED<br/>
CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF CASH FLOWS<br/>
FOR THE YEARS ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2025, 2024 AND 2023<br/>
(Stated in US Dollars)</b></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center">&#160;</p><div>

</div><table cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-spacing: 0px;">
